	text: [
		"The Automatic Thresher will harvest plants in a 7x7 area directly on front of it. ",
		"",
		"When fed fuel, it will extend every 10-15 second, harvesting anything it touches. ",
		"",
		"Crops like wheat and carrot are replanted automatically. ",
		"",
		"Sugar cane, cactus, Hemp, and Mustard Willow gets harvested leaving the lowest block intact, with Mustard willows only being harvested when they are mature.",
		"",
		"Sunflowers and tall grass get harvested but do not get broken as they are not growable crops",
		"",
		"Unlike the Automatic Buzzsaw, the Thresher will collect the harvested items and eject them at the back of the machine.",
		"",
		"Entities killed by the thresher's reel will yield small piles of nitra."
